```plaintext
Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```

```turtle
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/autonomous-driving#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

ex:Scene1 a ex:AutonomousDrivingScene ;
    ex:timestamp "2023-10-15T23:45:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    ex:location ex:UrbanStreet .

ex:Vehicle1 a ex:AutonomousVehicle ;
    ex:position "Center of the image" ;
    ex:direction "Forward" ;
    ex:speed "0 km/h"^^xsd:float .

ex:Pedestrian1 a ex:Pedestrian ;
    ex:position "Right side of the road, near the curb" ;
    ex:direction "Moving towards the camera" ;
    ex:action "Running" .

ex:SoccerBall1 a ex:Obstacle ;
    ex:position "Left side of the road" ;
    ex:distanceFromVehicle "10 meters"^^xsd:float .

ex:Road1 a ex:Road ;
    ex:type "UrbanStreet" ;
    ex:surfaceCondition "Dry" ;
    ex:lightingCondition "LowLight" .

ex:RoadMarking1 a ex:RoadInfrastructure ;
    ex:type "Curb" ;
    ex:position "Right side of the road" .

ex:Scene1 ex:contains ex:Vehicle1 .
ex:Scene1 ex:contains ex:Pedestrian1 .
ex:Scene1 ex:contains ex:SoccerBall1 .
ex:Scene1 ex:contains ex:Road1 .
ex:Scene1 ex:contains ex:RoadMarking1 .

ex:Vehicle1 ex:approaching ex:Pedestrian1 .
ex:Vehicle1 ex:near ex:SoccerBall1 .
ex:Pedestrian1 ex:crossing ex:Road1 .
ex:SoccerBall1 ex:on ex:Road1 .
```

```plaintext
Identified Risks for each risk class
```

**Risk 1:**
Description: The pedestrian is running across the road in low-light conditions, which may not be immediately visible to the autonomous vehicle due to poor visibility.
Severity Score: 0.85

**Risk 2:**
Description: The soccer ball on the road could be mistaken for an obstacle or a smaller pedestrian, leading to an incorrect reaction from the autonomous vehicle.
Severity Score: 0.7

**Risk 3:**
Description: The low-light condition increases the risk of the autonomous vehicle failing to detect the pedestrian or other obstacles in time.
Severity Score: 0.8

**Risk 4:**
Description: The pedestrian’s unpredictable movement (running) could lead to sudden changes in trajectory, increasing the risk of collision.
Severity Score: 0.85

**Risk 5:**
Description: The autonomous vehicle's sensors might not be calibrated to detect small objects like a soccer ball accurately in low-light conditions.
Severity Score: 0.65

```plaintext
Risk Classifications:
```

```turtle
@prefix risk: <http://example.org/risk#> .

ex:Risk1 a risk:PedestrianDetectionRisk ;
    risk:description "Pedestrian running across road in low-light conditions" ;
    risk:severity "0.85"^^xsd:float .

ex:Risk2 a risk:ObstacleMisidentificationRisk ;
    risk:description "Soccer ball mistaken for an obstacle or smaller pedestrian" ;
    risk:severity "0.7"^^xsd:float .

ex:Risk3 a risk:LowLightConditionRisk ;
    risk:description "Increased risk of failing to detect obstacles in low-light conditions" ;
    risk:severity "0.8"^^xsd:float .

ex:Risk4 a risk:UnpredictableMovementRisk ;
    risk:description "Sudden changes in pedestrian trajectory" ;
    risk:severity "0.85"^^xsd:float .

ex:Risk5 a risk:SensorCalibrationRisk ;
    risk:description "Sensors not calibrated to detect small objects accurately in low-light conditions" ;
    risk:severity "0.65"^^xsd:float .
```